      "rendered": "\u003Cp\u003EDescription Aretum is seeking a Visual Information Specialist to provide hands-on creative production support to the Marketing and Design Manager, Proposal &amp; Growth Team, and internal stakeholders. This role will develop polished, brand-compliant visual materials for proposals, executive presentations, marketing campaigns, digital content, and events while providing EST-aligned availability and occasional in-person support. The ideal [&hellip;]\u003C/p\u003E\n",
